{
  "_doc": "Rules-based triage for the non-personal mailboxes (D24). First matching rule wins. Actions: keep (stay in inbox), keep_star (stay + star), archive (remove from inbox, add the rule's label). Anything no rule matches STAYS in the inbox. Starred mail and senders you've written to in the last 90 days always stay. Built from the 2026-09-25 mailbox analysis.",
  "accounts": {
    "owlthat": {
      "labels": {
        "ci": "CoS/CI",
        "newsletters": "CoS/Newsletters",
        "notifications": "CoS/Notifications"
